        "html": "<div id=\"design-bg\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(0, 9, 30), rgb(10, 36, 114), rgb(19, 56, 190)); z-index: 1;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"shape\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 224.098px auto auto 87.1134px; width: 880px; height: 880px; background: rgb(253, 252, 240); z-index: 2; border-radius: 50%; outline: none; cursor: grab; opacity: 0.15 !important;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></div>\n        <h1 class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 301.675px auto auto 6.4433px; width: 1080px; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 120px; font-weight: 900; z-index: 4; opacity: 0.1; text-shadow: rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.8) 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; cursor: grab;\" contenteditable=\"false\">BREATHE.</h1>\n        <h1 class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 445.232px auto auto -3.22165px; width: 1080px; text-align: center; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-size: 82px; font-weight: 900; z-index: 4; outline: none; cursor: grab;\" contenteditable=\"false\">INNER PEACE</h1>\n        <p class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 685.438px auto auto 200px; width: 680px; text-align: center; color: rgb(147, 197, 253); font-size: 40px !important; font-weight: bold; z-index: 4; text-shadow: none; outline: none; cursor: grab;\" contenteditable=\"false\">Guided 10-Min Meditation.</p>\n        <p class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 757.449px auto auto 212.886px; width: 680px; text-align: center; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 30px !important; z-index: 4; line-height: 1.6; outline: none; cursor: grab;\" contenteditable=\"false\">Take a moment for yourself today. Focus on your inhalation and let go of all the tension with each out-breath. You deserve this stillness.</p>"
